WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
The four-button target-knockdown prerequisite leaves two bombs beside Ryu.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.150
Kimberly guards the recorded Ryu OD uppercut.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.350
An existing bomb hits Ryu after his guarded uppercut; no manual heavy starter is added.

4
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:03.750
Heavy-punch teleport follows the bomb launch.

5
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.150
Crouching heavy punch extends the juggle.

6
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.550
Another heavy-punch teleport repositions for standing medium punch.

7
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.350
Standing medium punch continues the juggle.

8
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.150
Sprint launcher extends the conversion.

9
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:06.600
Heavy bomb plant spends the last spray can.
